SQL> create table t_binary_fp_real_contract (
  2     id integer,
  3     bf_value binary_float,
  4     bd_value binary_double
  5 );

Succeed.

SQL> desc t_binary_fp_real_contract;

Name                                Null?    Type
----------------------------------- -------- ------------------------------------
ID                                           BINARY_INTEGER
BF_VALUE                                     BINARY_DOUBLE
BD_VALUE                                     BINARY_DOUBLE

